OL,3,GNEWSADecision expected four days before
OL,4,Aplanned Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe earliest date for a decision by the
OL,7,FParades Commission on the planned
OL,8,FDrumcree march by Portadown Orange
OL,9,FOrder is 23 September ` four days
OL,10,Fbefore the scheduled parade.
OL,12,FThe route the Order hopes to take -
OL,13,Fincluding the mainly-nationalist
OL,14,FGarvaghy Road - has been published on
OL,15,FParades Commission website.
OL,17,FIt states that on Sunday 27 September
OL,18,Fthe Order intends to start at 13:00 BST
OL,19,Fon Drumcree Road and finish in
OL,20,FPortadown town centre by 14:30.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
